B.Q3=new A.N(B.eg,["Droplet Web is open elsewhere","Droplet Web is open in another window or tab. Only one at a time receives your messages: click \u201cUse here\u201d to continue in this one.","Use here","Group calls happen on your phone for now.","Video","Voice","Click to record","Stop","Too large: 16 MB maximum.","Loading from your phone\u2026","Waiting for your phone: open Droplet on it to load your chats here.","On Droplet","About","Available, in a meeting, at the festival\u2026","Your contacts\u2019 updates, for 24 hours. Pick one on the left, or post your own.","Call your contacts with audio or video from your computer, end-to-end encrypted.","Your profile, appearance, notifications and linked devices. Everything is saved instantly.","Active now","Help","Add a contact","The person\u2019s Droplet username. They\u2019ll get your request on their phone.","Linked devices","Each linked device has its own keys. Your phone can remove it at any time from Settings \u203a Linked devices.","This browser has its own encryption keys. It sends and receives your messages itself, even when your phone is off.","Archived chats stay here, even when a new message arrives.","No phone linked (demo)","Help center","This device","Change background","Messages and calls are end-to-end encrypted. Click to verify.","Click for info","Compare these numbers with the ones on your contact\u2019s screen. If they match, no one is in between.","Terms of use","Privacy","Read receipts","When off, you won\u2019t see other people\u2019s read receipts, and they won\u2019t see yours.","Connecting\u2026","My contacts","Log out","This browser will forget your chats and its keys. You can link it again with the QR code.","Log out of this browser?","Previous chat","Next chat","Theme, color, text size","Clear call log","Emoji","Enter to send","On: Enter sends, Shift+Enter adds a line. Off: Ctrl+Enter sends.","Disappearing messages turned off","Try the demo","Close","Offline \xb7 messages will go out when you\u2019re back online","Connected","Chat info","Link my phone","Mark as read","Mark as unread","Media, links and docs","Message not found","This message was deleted","Demo \xb7 nothing leaves this browser","Make admin","Browser notifications","Notifications only appear when the Droplet Web tab isn\u2019t in front. Content stays encrypted all the way to this browser.","Blocked by the browser: allow them in the site settings.","1 unread message","{n} unread messages","The start of your chat with {nom}","The start of {nom}","Your messages get through even when the network goes down. Say something:","Hi! \ud83d\udc4b","Where are you?","Where shall we meet?","New line","Photos","More","You\u2019re no longer a member of this group.","Profile","Your profile is the same on all your devices.","Username","This is the name your contacts see.","Keyboard shortcuts","React","Recent","Search in chat","Dismiss as admin","Security","Your updates are end-to-end encrypted and disappear after 24 hours.","Messages disappear from this browser. Your other devices keep them.","Delete message?","Delete for me","The message disappears from your devices only.","Delete for everyone","Download","Main phone","Holds the account identity and signs linked devices","Enter","Mark all as read","Message a contact or create a group: your chats will show up here.","Clear","Clear chat","All messages in this chat will be erased from this browser.","Voice message","Show in chat","You","You deleted this message","{nom} left the group","{qui} removed {nom}","{qui} renamed the group to \u201c{titre}\u201d","Group created on {date}","Drop here to send to {nom}","Send to {nom}","Message {nom}","Disappearing messages on: {duree}","{n} group(s) in common"],t.w)
